====== MikroTik RBwAPR-2nD (wAP R) ======

The MikroTik RouterBOARD RBwAPR-2nD (wAP R) is a small weatherproof 2.4 GHz access point with a miniPCI-e slot and a SIM card slot for an LTE modem, a LoRa gateway or an extra wireless radio. The device has three powering options: 9-30V PoE in, DC jack and automotive connector.

See more at [[https://mikrotik.com/product/RBwAPR-2nD]].

